Credit cloning means you repeatedly buy the same objects on credit and
sell them for cash. It's just convenient if you have all the clutter
in one bag. Your pet then steals a large pile of gold once your credit
is exhausted.

You do not throw objects in at all, unless you are doing something
entirely different: price identification. If Izchak is the only
shopkeeper in the entire game, you might well have to.


